query lang-any
  | from texts
  | find "Boaz" lang:any
refused: SMY-E461 `lang:any` asks for a bridge between languages (SMYSL-2.5 §3.5), and the one this build has is the embedding bridge, which needs `~sem` (or a `~hybrid` that routes semantic); the pure bridges — alignment, classes, entity aliases — are not built
